Let's see: mumak can butt for 4d12 and bite for 2d6. In the absolutely worst
case (both attacks hit and do maximum damage - very unprobable) this sums
up to 60 HP. So either you were not at max hit points, or you were seriously
encumbered and he got several attacks. And yes, mumak is supposed to be 
tough, most hackers will tell you that ;-)

